# Normalise all text files to LF, both in the repository and in the working
# tree. Without this the LF guarantee depends on every contributor's local
# core.autocrlf setting, which is exactly the kind of per-machine assumption
# that broke when this project moved from Windows to Linux.
#
# Verified 2026-07-28 with `git ls-files --eol`: all 312 tracked text files
# were already i/lf w/lf (zero crlf, zero mixed), so this introduces no
# renormalisation churn.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets - never touch line endings.
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.ico    binary
*.ttf    binary
*.otf    binary
*.jar    binary
*.apk    binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks    binary
